{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/creek-rise-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":364,"crm_id":"2083","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Creek Rise","slug":"creek-rise-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","display_address":"Dubai Creek Harbour","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":4053888,"display_price":"4.053M","lattitude":25.2064181,"longitude":55.3467655,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Creek Rise is two beautifully designed residential towers of 36 and 46 storeys, presented by developer Emaar. The development offers a wide range of <strong>one to three bedroom apartments</strong> in a sophisticated style, featuring spacious modern living spaces with stunning views of the modern metropolis. They offer mesmerizing views of Dubai Creek Harbour and the parklands below. The elegant residences are furnished with carefully selected furniture and finishes.</p><p>Creek Rise features a cafe, gymnasium, park, restaurants, adult and children's pools, playground, and barbecue areas. There is also a covered parking lot for residents' cars and a separate one for guests, 24-hour security. The complex provides concierge services and is happy to accommodate pets.</p><p>Located at the north end of Creek Island, the complex has direct access to the island's circular boulevard. The project is just a short walk from Creek Marina, a 5-star luxury marina, and with its transport interchange at Ras Al Khor Road and easy access to Dubai's major roads, Downtown Dubai and Dubai International Airport are only 10-15 minutes away.</p><p>Creek Rise is the perfect place for comfortable living in modern and stylish surroundings with a variety of amenities and magnificent views of the city. The complex is also ideal for couples with children, and investors can earn a stable income from renting out the complex's properties.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2083/images/2024/06/02/o0Lo1HROeps4eCkTTpaTJeJEGjUT6r4rhiZMfklX.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/02/o0Lo1HROeps4eCkTTpaTJeJEGjUT6r4rhiZMfklX.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2083/images/2024/06/01/gXaVWUX5HI46EaZrzMRPAubp9j7t3CRrWUPirxK1.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/01/gXaVWUX5HI46EaZrzMRPAubp9j7t3CRrWUPirxK1.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2083/images/2024/06/01/nuFY2fJnKtR3yOVPcP5KaHoCjzBYPTCo3nc2tV30.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/01/nuFY2fJnKtR3yOVPcP5KaHoCjzBYPTCo3nc2tV30.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2083/images/2024/06/01/LXVUEv6pE4Y3N7pDcqUoN1ltW5wCfis92hC1hSxJ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/01/LXVUEv6pE4Y3N7pDcqUoN1ltW5wCfis92hC1hSxJ.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2083/images/2024/06/01/JNckm9QY1EwcZKGDfTBGxWZVETtSItw0EAWIPkA0.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/01/JNckm9QY1EwcZKGDfTBGxWZVETtSItw0EAWIPkA0.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2996,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/05/30/MOKP126ZyJJGRdo5RccMypXPMaGk34U4t5yL0QWs.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1488,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1579,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1580,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"medi